  "Q00021_HiddenTruth/31349-03.html": {
   "file": "Q00021_HiddenTruth/31349-03.html",
   "quest": 21,
   "text": "Benedict: Maybe the devil worshippers are hiding in a library somewhere, they still need to acquire knowledge. They couldn't be here in the temple!",
   "header": "Benedict",
   "when": [
    "cond 6; st.getInt(\"AGRIPEL\") == 1; st.getInt(\"DOMINIC\") == 1; st.getInt(\"BENEDICT\") == 1",
    "cond 7; !(st.hasQuestItems(CROSS_OF_EINHASAD) && st.isCond(6))"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00021_HiddenTruth/31349-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00021_HiddenTruth/31349-02.html",
   "quest": 21,
   "text": "Benedict: Maybe he was the guy who long ago was expelled for keeping a devil worshipper with him! He's probably a beggar now. I don't waste my time with such filth.",
   "header": "Benedict",
   "when": [
    "cond 6; !((st.getInt(\"AGRIPEL\") == 1) && (st.getInt(\"DOMINIC\") == 1) && (st.getInt(\"BENEDICT\") == 1)); ((st.getInt(\"AGRIPEL\") == 1) || (st.getInt(\"DOMINIC\") == 1))"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00021_HiddenTruth/31349-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00021_HiddenTruth/31349-01.html",
   "quest": 21,
   "text": "Benedict: Is Innocentin one of those devil worshippers executed in the old witch trials? I never heard of him, ask someone else.",
   "header": "Benedict",
   "when": [
    "cond 6; !((st.getInt(\"AGRIPEL\") == 1) && (st.getInt(\"DOMINIC\") == 1) && (st.getInt(\"BENEDICT\") == 1)); !((st.getInt(\"AGRIPEL\") == 1) || (st.getInt(\"DOMINIC\") == 1))"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
